## ⚡ Performance Strategy

### **Three-Tier Computation Strategy**

| Computation | When | Where | Cost |
|-------------|------|-------|------|
| **Batch update** (incremental belief update) | Every 2s | Python process | ~10-50ms |
| **Consolidation** (short→long term) | Every 6 hours | Background task | ~1-5s |
| **Deep analysis** (pattern extraction) | Before evolution run | On-demand | ~10-30s |

### **Critical: Only Compute Bayesian Surprise on Batches**

```python
