**Neuro-memory should return this minimal interface to evolution:**

```typescript
interface NeuroMemoryInsights {
  // What to avoid (hard constraints)
  failurePatterns: FailurePattern[];    

  // What to reinforce (objectives)
  successPatterns: SuccessPattern[];    

  // What to explore (hypotheses)
  surpriseEvents: SurpriseEvent[];      

  // What to do (directives - PRIMARY INPUT)
  recommendations: Recommendation[];    

  // How much to trust this data
